{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>今日（26日）傍晚六時許，中環怡和大廈有兩名工人在吊船工作，被困於30至40樓外牆。消防處在六分鐘後到場，高空拯救專隊人員（俗稱「飛將軍」）從天台游繩而下，將兩名被困工人帶到安全位置。其中一名工人由消防員游繩送到地下，另一名工人則由消防員游繩送上天台。兩人其後送院接受檢查。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/fire-1-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em> 怡和大廈吊船故障，消防員從天台游繩而下，救出兩名被困工人。（消防處圖片）</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/fire-2-768x1024.jpeg\" width=\"768\"/><figcaption><strong><em> 怡和大廈吊船故障，消防員從天台部署救人。（消防處圖片）</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/fire-3-768x1024.jpeg\" width=\"768\"/><figcaption> 怡和大廈吊船故障，其中一名被困工人，由消防員游<strong><em>繩</em></strong>送到地面。（消防處圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/fire-4-473x1024.jpeg\" width=\"473\"/><figcaption><strong><em> 怡和大廈吊船故障，消防員救出兩名被困工人。（消防處圖片）</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0N5A5700-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p><strong><em>消防員一度充氣，完成救援後將氣墊放氣。</em></strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0N5A5697-1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:09.911957+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":7,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:59:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:12.515111+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:16.061036+00:00","content_hash":"1243a58ba18556e00d2951f2973df1ecd4edcc3b2056583ee5542a141929f9d7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}